# The Trislab framework packages come from GitHub Packages, which asks for a token even for a public package:
# CI passes the workflow's token as PACKAGES_TOKEN, a developer sets a personal token with read:packages
# (docs/getting-started.md). npm.org stays the registry of everything else.
@trislabcompany:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${PACKAGES_TOKEN}
